  "description": "Uptime, availability, and probe latency for the 10 Jenkins masters. Fed by the jenkins-uptime addon: blackbox-exporter probes every master's /login on the internal path (peering, isolates the master from the ingress chain) and the external path (public ALB, the true user path). jenkins:* series are recording rules evaluated by the Mimir ruler; see ADR 0031.",
